Files are used unmodified, as published upstream:

  stars.6.json       XHIP: An Extended Hipparcos Compilation
                     Anderson E., Francis C. (2012)
  starnames.json     HD-DM-GC-HR cross index; FK5-SAO-HD index;
                     General Catalogue of Variable Stars;
                     Gliese Catalogue of Nearby Stars
  mw.json            Milky Way Outline Catalog, Jose R. Vieira

All coordinates are epoch J2000.

