Paper textures  --  web/starchart/textures.js
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Two public-domain paper scans from Wikimedia Commons, embedded as data
URIs after trimming, downscaling and re-compression:

  Old paper6.jpg        https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Old_paper6.jpg
  Old Paper texture.jpg https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Old_Paper_texture.jpg

Both are marked public domain on Commons.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not used
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project does not incorporate any code from modhtom/StarMap, which
carries a non-commercial licence whose terms extend to derivative works.
The catalogue files that repository ships are themselves d3-celestial's,
and are taken here from d3-celestial directly under the BSD terms above.

The design being reproduced is a 19th-century celestial chart of a type
long in the public domain. No part of any modern scan or reproduction is
traced or embedded; every mark is generated from the catalogue data.
